L=\int_0^{5}\|(\bf r\it'(t)\|\,dt= \int_0^{5}\sqrt{x'(t)^2+y'(t)^2+z'(t)^2}\,dt
=\int_0^{5}\sqrt{(-2)^2+4^2+(-3)^2}\,dt= 5 \sqrt{29}

